  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MMエグザビークルシリーズにカスタマイズやディスプレイの幅が広がる「カスタマイズキャリアVer.」が登場！キャリア部分の昇降や展開によって様々なアレンジが可能な車両型エグザビークル！",
      "en": "\"Customized Carrier Ver.\", which expands the range of customization and display, is now available in the 30MM EXA VEHICLE series! A vehicle-type EXA vehicle that can be arranged in various ways by raising and lowering and deploying the carrier part!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キャリア部分は展開が可能。支柱の調節で好みの高さや角度にも設定ができる。",
      "en": "• The carrier part can be expanded. You can set it to your desired height and angle by adjusting the pillars."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 仕切り版が付属し、キャリア部分の分割や装甲車風のアレンジカスタマイズも可能。",
      "en": "• A partition version is included, allowing you to divide the carrier part and customize the arrangement to look like an armored car."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キャリア部分は上左右へのスライド拡張ギミックを搭載。これにより大型機体も積載可能。",
      "en": "• The carrier part is equipped with a sliding expansion gimmick to the top and left. This makes it possible to load large aircraft."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 付属のジョイントを使用して、本商品同士の縦連結、横連結、カスタマイズシーンベースその他30MM商品との幅広いカスタマイズが楽しめる。",
      "en": "• Using the included joints, you can enjoy a wide range of customization by vertically connecting, horizontally connecting, customizing scene bases, and other 30MM products."
    }
  ],
